SUMMARY:Portland / Multnomah County\, OR: Form SP due
DESCRIPTION:15th day of the 4th month after the tax year ends (calendar-yea
 r filer) | Due April 15\, 2026 for calendar-year 2025 filers\, per Portland
  City Code 7.02.510 A.2\, Metro Code 7.05.170(a)\, and Multnomah County Cod
 e section 11.530 A / 12.510(A). The one-month extension referenced on this 
 page applies to C corporations only\, not individual filers. | Authority: D
 irect fetch of portland.gov/revenue this session | Source: https://www.port
 land.gov/revenue/policy-tax-return-due-dates | This date is computed from a
